---
import ProjectArticle from "#layouts/project-article.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import book from "#assets/athens-portal/book.jpeg";
import discover from "#assets/athens-portal/discover.jpeg";
import homepage from "#assets/athens-portal/homepage.jpeg";
import logo from "#assets/athens-portal/logo-full.jpeg";
import reviews from "#assets/athens-portal/reviews.jpeg";
import Section from "#components/section.astro";
---

<ProjectArticle
  title="Athens Portal"
  description="A mobile app built for my bachelor's degree final paper."
  image={logo}
  imageAlt="Athens Portal logo"
>
  <Section name="Background">
    <p>
      Back on those first days in college, me and my colleagues struggled when
      it comes to finding books with reliable information.
    </p>
    <p>
      Professors often shared works that could help us, but sometimes some of
      those books were expensive or unavaibled at the college's library.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section name="The app">
    <p>
      Users could use this app without an account, but with some limitations.
    </p>
    <p>
      Registered people could index new books and review them, giving a rating
      and a commentary if they want.
    </p>
    <p>
      Also, users could define what genres they liked, and the app would give a
      list of books related to their likings.
    </p>

    <div class="gallery">
      <Image src={homepage} alt="" />
      <Image src={discover} alt="" />
      <Image src={book} alt="" />
      <Image src={reviews} alt="" />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section name="Technical details">
    <p>The app was made using Dart/Flutter with a Node.js backend.</p>

    <p>
      Indexing worked by using third-party APIs. Books were indexed when people
      searched for it the first time. Although it wasn't visible, the system
      used to save what user indexed each work. We were planning on adding some
      kind of reward for people that helped more on indexing books.
    </p>

    <p>For more info refer to this document</p>
  </Section>
</ProjectArticle>

<style is:global>
  .gallery {
    margin: 4rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: nowrap;
    height: 300px;
    gap: 3rem;
    justify-content: center;

    img {
      width: auto;
      height: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>
